      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>A poem-blessing for trailblazers of many kinds, to honor everyday courage and to inspire trust and self-compassion. May we get the support we need as we midwife the world to come.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>“Blessing for Myself and for You” (alternately: “The Trailblazer’s Blessing”) was written by Kohenet Ilana Joy Streit in January 2016.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>[Financial contributions are most welcome, and support further creation and sharing of Ilana’s creative work. You can see and hear more of Ilana’s creative work on her Patreon page. Or to make a one-time contribution, Venmo (@Ilana-Streit).]</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_30587_notes"/>
